\statement{\name_instruction[1] \list \name_instruction[2]
<ul><li>\name_mean[1] \(a\) \name_mean[2] \(b) \name_mean[3] \m1.
</li><li>\name_mean[1] \(b) \name_mean[2] \(c) \name_mean[3] \m2.
</li><li>\name_mean[1] \(c) \name_mean[2] \(d) \name_mean[3] \m3.
